// Source recipe: packages/core/src/shaders/Nebula/index.ts and std/paint/volume.ts.
// Retained: six-sample front-to-back emission/absorption, domain-warped three-octave
// gas, cavity/ridge/dust terms, two occluded star planes, shell refraction, five-bank
// studio reflection, dual-lobe glint and neutral tone curve.
// Adapters: cached flat-font SDF/coverage instead of a sphere; float-only gradient
// noise and Worley hashes instead of uint MaterialX hashes; linear-sRGB color ramp;
// glyph-height domain and caption-local time. No numerical pixel-equivalence claim.

